@api = http://localhost:5080

### Valid bond order (expect 202 Accepted)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-001

{
  "clientOrderId": "MANUAL-0001",
  "sourceSystem": "Calypso",
  "messageType": "Order",
  "instrumentId": "CAN-2.75-2035",
  "side": "Buy",
  "quantity": 5000000,
  "price": 97.45,
  "currency": "CAD",
  "portfolio": "CAD-FI-CORE",
  "tradeTime": "2026-10-14T14:30:00Z"
}

### Same order again (expect 200, same OrderId: idempotent)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientOrderId": "MANUAL-0001",
  "sourceSystem": "Calypso",
  "messageType": "Order",
  "instrumentId": "CAN-2.75-2035",
  "side": "Buy",
  "quantity": 5000000,
  "price": 97.45,
  "currency": "CAD",
  "portfolio": "CAD-FI-CORE",
  "tradeTime": "2026-10-14T14:30:00Z"
}

### Fat-finger price (expect 422)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientOrderId": "MANUAL-0002",
  "sourceSystem": "Calypso",
  "messageType": "Order",
  "instrumentId": "RY.TO",
  "side": "Sell",
  "quantity": 1000,
  "price": 265.00,
  "currency": "CAD",
  "portfolio": "CAD-EQ-ACTIVE",
  "tradeTime": "2026-10-14T14:30:00Z"
}

### Reconciliation
GET {{api}}/api/reconciliation
